        "how": "The first Check downloads the C++ compiler (about 26 MB) and compiles in 10 to 15 s. Later Checks take 1 to 3 s. Ten hidden tests. They include the l2 clash, an 8 × 8 matrix both ways and strides 2 and 3. Also an empty list and a set one line too small."
